  "description": "This is a fine-tuned hybrid Automatic Speech Recognition (ASR) model with 115 million parameters, trained on over 10,000 hours of diverse, manually transcribed French speech including punctuation. It supports both Transducer and CTC decoding strategies and demonstrates robust performance across various datasets like CommonVoice and SUMM-RE. The model is limited by potential struggles with rare vocabulary, heavy accents, overlapping audio, and punctuations on long segments.",
